{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆 おはようさん\\(*´−`*)/\nろってぃーだよ？ まにだよ？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゆうりとぉ〜..*"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mahiro.kawamura/img/blog/mahiro.kawamura/img/2014/11/15/1947196/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日は１日NOGIBINGO!3デイだったよ.♪\nあいかわらず楽しい収録でした..*"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"イジリーさんは一緒にお仕事すればするほど\nいい人っていうのが伝わってきます^^"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あっ！  キャラ設定壊れるかなあ (^-^)笑？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも今週のアメトーク見ましたけど、\nそこに居た芸人さん方 皆が\n「先輩さすがですね〜*^^*」ってすごい慕っていたんで、\n『ああ、やっぱり皆に本当に愛されてる人なんだなあ〜。』って思いました\\^^/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"、、、にしても〜\n収録でずっと照明に当たってると眼球痛いね....。\nお目目 冷やそう。へへ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぢゃん。   あすかと。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mahiro.kawamura/img/blog/mahiro.kawamura/img/2014/11/15/1947196/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そう。\nこの洋服と言えば〜、 のぎ天です!!!(・А・)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私達のご褒美ロケ旅〜鎌倉編〜が\n一週目 配信されました〜..*    皆 見たかな〜？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆 私服だし、いつもの素の私達が出てます 笑へへ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また飛鳥に「あいつアホだよ。アホ。アホ。」\nって言われてたよ。。。 *^^*ははは\n生意気な妹だ。   ウソウソ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mahiro.kawamura/img/blog/mahiro.kawamura/img/2014/11/15/1947196/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大好きや..*"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mahiro.kawamura/img/blog/mahiro.kawamura/img/2014/11/15/1947196/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＿＿＿＿＿＿＿＿＿＿＿＿＿＿＿"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一昨日、加藤ミリヤさんと清水翔太さんのライブに行ってきました！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に、感動したし勉強になったし最高に楽しかったです！\nすごいいい刺激をもらいました.♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やっぱり 自分は歌が好き！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ミリヤさんや翔太さんの様なかっこいい歌手にならなきゃ\\(><)/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また行きたいです..*"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じゃあ今日も自分らしく頑張ろうね〜*"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日のスケジュールは\n眠気なんて吹っ飛ばして頑張らなくちゃ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mahiro.kawamura/img/blog/mahiro.kawamura/img/2014/11/15/1947196/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大好きだよ。？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"のし。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まひろ"}],"source":"archive"}